</mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <div id=\"selectList-184672-9\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-184672-9\" style=\"width: 51px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">odd</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 966px; top: 5278px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">even</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">odd</div></div></div>.  </div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p></p><p>Recall the following:</p><p></p>\n<p></p><ul><p></p>\n<p></p><li><p>If an integer <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"63\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is even, then there exists an integer <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"64