tFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-184783-7\" style=\"width: 131px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">an integer</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 913px; top: 14922px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">a natural number</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">negative</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">an integer</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">positive</div></div></div>.</span><span class=\"proofSection\"></span><span class=\"proofSection\"><p></p>Therefore, we have<p></p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"533\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 8.64em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><div id=\"selectList-184783-8\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-184783-8\" style=\"width: 67px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"529\" style=\"font-size: 100%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-T